message: "If you use this code or these results, please cite the manuscript below."
title: "mmwave-respiratory-null"
abstract: "Code and results for a closed-form depth bound on respiratory-phase multipath nulls in mmWave cardiac radar: when the static and breathing phasors in one range bin become comparable in amplitude, the complex trajectory passes through the origin and the phase collapses; chirp bandwidth is identified as the design knob that sets the null rate."
